.opencode/

# Local engineering notes, kept out of the published repository and its sdist
tech_debt/
known_fixes/

# Private local broker state. The defaults normally live outside the project in
# a per-user state directory; these patterns protect explicit project-local paths.
.modulith-broker.db*
.modulith-broker-*.db*
.modulith-shm-broker.db*
.modulith-shm-broker-*.db*
.modulith-*.db-journal
.modulith-*.hints
# SQLite sidecars and SHM hint files may use explicit non-default basenames.
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
*.hints
*.mmap
.*.hints.*.tmp
.*.mmap.*.tmp

# Abstra
#   Abstra is an AI-powered process automation framework.
#   Ignore directories containing user credentials, local state, and settings.
